A||||12||Cheever2||It's time to sign up for the Fiero Parts Relay||||2||
Z||000000||Cheever2||05-26-2001||03:44 AM||||Just in case you missed what this is about, read here: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007587.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/007587.html</A> <P>The time has come for me to invite the North American Forum members who can participate to send me an e-mail.  Include your city and state or province, and describe any limitations regarding the distance you're willing to travel and size & weight of what you can carry.  <P>We already have an excellent start underway, mostly going north & south, especially in the Ohio River valley.  But there are not enough signed up yet to do anything for anybody.  <P>If you cannot or just don't desire to be a part of this, that is fine.  You will not be excluded from the opportunity to use the service.  If you're not sure that you can be of any help, sign up anyway, because when someone makes a request of you, then you can work it out with them.  If you are unable to accommodate them, they'll contact someone else.<P>If you sign up now, you will not start getting requests right away.  The website is almost complete, but I'm still fielding opinions (I'll post the URL soon).  A form letter is being written which will be email'd to FOLD members and Fiero clubs.  Once that is done, then this thing will be a reality, and we can start helping each other in a whole new way.<P>The responses I have received have been wonderful.  Even the criticisms have been positive and helpful.  Thank you all very much.<BR>||||reg||2
